OB_BOR_level|BOR Level|BOR Level||||These bits contain the supply level threshold that activates/releases the reset. They can be written to program a new BOR level value into Flash memory. BOR level 0 (reset level threshold around 2.1 V). BOR level 1 (reset level threshold around 2.1 V). BOR level 2 (reset level threshold around 2.4 V). BOR level 3 (reset level threshold around 2.7 V)
