OB_DTCM_AXI_SHARE|DTCM_AXI_SHARE|DTCM size configuration||||DTCM AXI share FLASH Option Byte. - DTCM_AXI_SHARE = "0" or "3": DTCM 64 Kbytes - DTCM_AXI_SHARE = "1": DTCM 128 Kbytes - DTCM_AXI_SHARE = "2": DTCM 192 Kbytes <font color="green">Once DTCM Flash Option Byte is updated and Memory Management Tool (MMT) is not enabled, Linker file should be adapted manually in the generated project in order to benefit from the mapping change.</font>
OB_ITCM_active|Activate|ITCM size configuration||||
OB_ITCM_AXI_SHARE|ITCM_AXI_SHARE|ITCM size configuration||||ITCM AXI share FLASH Option Byte. -ITCM_AXI_SHARE: = "0" or "3": ITCM 64 Kbytes. -ITCM_AXI_SHARE = "1": ITCM 128 Kbytes. -ITCM_AXI_SHARE = "2": ITCM 192 Kbytes. <font color="green">Once ITCM Flash Option Byte is updated and Memory Management Tool (MMT) is not enabled, Linker file should be adapted manually in the generated project in order to benefit from the mapping change.</font>
